Z||000008||mrfiero||04-02-2001||01:16 AM||||Wayne,<P>I'm grabbing the calipers, so I can get you that left rear one that is locked up on your "new" Formula.  I also picked up an engraved plenum (on an '85 GT of all things)......LMK if you want it since your Formula has the sticker (someone replaced it at some point).<P>JoeJoe,<P>I think only one fascia is good (and I need one!), but I'll double check.  I grabbed the speedo bezel from one today.......I'll see what the others have in the morning.  BTW.....5-sp. or auto.?<P>Jeff,<P>I may or may not grab the links this time (just too much to get and not enough time or $$).  I do have some links at home though, so no problem there.<P>Mark,<P>I didn't see any fleece seats at all, but I'll check again.  I have only seen one or two level 3 cars in junkyards......the last one was a year ago, so don't hold your breath.  I'll keep an eye out for them though.<P>Hank,<P>I have a good impact bar at home.  I'll grab a good honeycomb from the junkyard (I don't hav one).   I picked up one good marker light, but I know one of the coupes has all 4 in good shape......you have first dibs.  I'll check the emblems too.......I believe one or two still had them.  Shipping an impact bar is no big deal.....they really don't weight that much.  I have shipped out a few and it wasn't exhorbitant.<P>fyerstarter,<P>Do  you mean the "bullet" moldings?  I saw no fastbacks, so I can't help you out....sorry.<BR>  <P>Anyone else?  <P>How about a mint solid gray dash?  Mint gray '85 GT seats?  '87-'88 headlight motors?  <P>I'll be posting a bunch of stuff in the mall as soon as I can secure everything.  I hope I have enough cash for it all.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">    <P><p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 04-02-2001).]||||reg||6
